     },
     {
      "id": "p2",
      "description": "A1 $(1 + x)^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\approx 1 + \\frac{1}{2}x - \\frac{1}{8}x^2$.",
      "marks": 1
     },
     {
      "id": "p3",
      "description": "A1 $(1 - x)^{-\\frac{1}{2}} \\approx 1 + \\frac{1}{2}x + \\frac{3}{8}x^2$.",
